  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418680
    - rid: 9079475098267418681
    - rid: 9079475089592287313
    - rid: 9079475110781911284
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Finally done with my homework. Friggin' hate Mondays.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418682
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I can't believe that our teacher made us read a whole chapter for our
      history homework.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We're high-schoolers, for goodness sake! (Not to be confused with <i>high</i>
      schoolers.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess I can get gaming now. Let me see if Allen is online...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh. He's usually online by now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh. That's right. He's in the Robotics Club or whatever.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Who am I supposed to spend my evenings with now?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Max is too busy playing rhythm games, Patrick is always at some card
      game shop, and Sayori-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I miss Sayori. Ever since she started sleeping in after the start of
      high school, I haven't been able to hang out with her like I used to.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hell, that's the main reason I even started talking to Allen, who I would
      have to consider my current best friend.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Enough wallowing, I guess I''ll start my 35th playthrough of: "The Elder
      Scrolls V: Skyrim."'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418683
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: (Why did I say the full title like that?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418684
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I boot up Skyrim and start a new playthrough, going until it's time to
      get ready for bed.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After a nice warm shower, I'm ready to face tomorrow.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418685
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hopefully tomorrow's homework isn't as garbage as today's...
    ScreenActions: []
